      "content": "As an online shop in Lyon, you'll need to comply with the European General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) principles. For customer email addresses, you should only collect them when necessary (e.g., for order confirmations or newsletters) and provide an option to unsubscribe from these communications. For shipping addresses, you should only collect the necessary information for order processing (e.g., city, postal code) and consider allowing customers to anonymize or pseudonymize their data if desired.",
