    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. one thing that worries me is data security. i'm worried about stuff happening behind the scenes that i might not notice right away, like if there's some kind of sneaky breach or unauthorized access to my customer files. what are the main things i should do to prevent those kinds of hidden issues?",
