      "content": "To prevent hidden data security issues, ensure your website and databases are using HTTPS encryption for all web traffic, and keep your software and plugins up-to-date. Regularly monitor your website's security logs and implement a web application firewall (WAF) to detect and block suspicious activity. Additionally, use strong passwords, limit access to customer data, and consider using a reputable security service like DSGVO (German data protection authority) compliant security tools.",
